<main id="main" lang="en" dir="ltr" tabindex="-1" class="operator-page ux-workspace "><header class="ux-page-heading"><p class="label">TEAM WORKSPACE</p><h1>Supply Sources</h1></header><p class="supply-mode"><span class="mr-mode" data-mode="sample">Sample</span></p><div class="supply-head"><p class="supply-quiet">Where candidate companies come from, and the rules each source follows.</p><p class="supply-head-end"><a class="text-link" href="/operator/supply/do-not-contact?workspace=00000000-0000-4000-8000-0000000000a1">Do Not Contact</a></p></div><div class="ux-subtabs"><div class="ux-subtabs-list" role="tablist" aria-label="Supply sections"><button id="_r_-tab-sources" type="button" role="tab" class="ux-subtabs-tab" data-tab="sources" aria-selected="true" aria-controls="_r_-panel-sources" tabindex="0">Sources</button><button id="_r_-tab-missions" type="button" role="tab" class="ux-subtabs-tab" data-tab="missions" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="_r_-panel-missions" tabindex="-1">Missions</button><button id="_r_-tab-route-kinds" type="button" role="tab" class="ux-subtabs-tab" data-tab="route-kinds" aria-selected="false" aria-controls="_r_-panel-route-kinds" tabindex="-1">Route Kinds</button></div><div id="_r_-panel-sources" role="tabpanel" class="ux-subtabs-panel" data-subtab="sources" aria-labelledby="_r_-tab-sources"><section class="supply-flow" aria-labelledby="supply-sources-heading"><h2 id="supply-sources-heading" class="sr-only">Sources</h2><div class="ux-empty"><svg class="corridra-icon ux-empty-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M4 16V4h7v12M11 8h5v8M2.5 16h15M6.5 7h2M6.5 10h2M6.5 13h2"></path></svg><p>No sources yet. Create a staff research source before adding candidates.</p></div><ul class="supply-list" aria-label="Supply sources"></ul><details class="supply-disclosure"><summary>New Source</summary><form class="operator-form"><p class="supply-quiet">Step 1 of 2</p><div><h3 tabindex="-1">What kind of source is this?</h3><fieldset class="supply-choices"><legend>Source kind</legend><label class="supply-choice"><input type="radio" value="staff_research" checked="" name="kind"><span>Staff Research</span></label><p class="supply-quiet">Corridra staff read public sources and write down what they find. No agreement is needed.</p><div><label class="supply-choice"><input disabled="" aria-describedby="why-partner_organisation" type="radio" value="partner_organisation" name="kind"><span>Partner Organisation</span></label><p id="why-partner_organisation" class="supply-quiet">Locked. Partner sources are not open yet. They need an agreement on record and the owner's approval.</p></div><div><label class="supply-choice"><input disabled="" aria-describedby="why-partner_person" type="radio" value="partner_person" name="kind"><span>Partner Person</span></label><p id="why-partner_person" class="supply-quiet">Locked. Partner sources are not open yet. They need an agreement on record and the owner's approval.</p></div><div><label class="supply-choice"><input disabled="" aria-describedby="why-data_platform" type="radio" value="data_platform" name="kind"><span>Data Platform</span></label><p id="why-data_platform" class="supply-quiet">Locked. Data platform sources are not open yet. They need an agreement, an approved connection and the owner's approval.</p></div></fieldset><button type="button" class="primary-link">Next</button></div><div hidden=""><h3 tabindex="-1">Describe the source</h3><label class="field">Source label<input minlength="3" maxlength="120" aria-describedby="source-label-hint" name="label"><span id="source-label-hint" class="supply-quiet">Internal name, for example the website or register staff read.</span></label><div class="ux-kit-field"><label class="ux-kit-label" for="_r_-input">Evidence record</label><p class="ux-kit-hint" id="_r_-hint">The record that shows where this source comes from.</p><div class="ux-kit-combo"><input id="_r_-input" class="ux-kit-input" role="combobox" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_-list" aria-autocomplete="list" aria-describedby="_r_-hint" autocomplete="off" placeholder="Type to search" value=""><input type="hidden" value="" name="sourceRecordId"></div></div><label class="field">Keep records for (months)<input min="1" max="24" type="number" value="12" name="months"><span class="supply-quiet">Candidates from this source expire after this time, or earlier if the evidence record ends sooner.</span></label><div class="operator-toolbar"><button type="button" class="text-link">Back</button><button class="primary-link" aria-disabled="false">Create Source</button></div></div><div data-feedback-scope="source-new" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div></form></details></section></div><div id="_r_-panel-missions" role="tabpanel" class="ux-subtabs-panel" data-subtab="missions" aria-labelledby="_r_-tab-missions" hidden=""><section aria-labelledby="supply-missions-heading"><h2 id="supply-missions-heading" class="sr-only">Missions</h2><div class="ux-empty"><svg class="corridra-icon ux-empty-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 14h3v3H3zM14 3h3v3h-3zM6 15.5h3.5v-11H14"></path></svg><p>No missions yet. A mission appears here once the team creates one.</p></div><ul class="supply-list" aria-label="Supply missions"></ul></section></div><div id="_r_-panel-route-kinds" role="tabpanel" class="ux-subtabs-panel" data-subtab="route-kinds" aria-labelledby="_r_-tab-route-kinds" hidden=""><section aria-labelledby="supply-routes-heading"><h2 id="supply-routes-heading" class="sr-only">Route Kinds</h2><p class="supply-quiet">Which kinds of source each route can use. Staff Research is always allowed. Other kinds appear only when the route's pack lists them. Change this by publishing a new route pack, not here.</p><div class="ux-empty"><svg class="corridra-icon ux-empty-icon" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square" stroke-linejoin="miter" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M3 14h3v3H3zM14 3h3v3h-3zM6 15.5h3.5v-11H14"></path></svg><p>No routes are set up yet.</p></div></section></div></div></main>